<title>USA: Israel Land Development Co yr net rises.</title>
<headline>Israel Land Development Co yr net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996	     1995</p>
<p> Revenue			 $302,155	$275,738</p>
<p> Capital Gains, net	     3,398	   1,979</p>
<p>Company's share in gains</p>
<p>  of subsidiaries		 2,782	   2,069</p>
<p> Net income			 4,597	   4,281</p>
<p>Net income per share</p>
<p>  (fully diluted)		  0.16	    0.15</p>
<p> Shares outstanding	    28,269	  28,269</p>
<p>(Figures in thousands except per share)</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>All dollar figures represent convenience translations using an exchange rate of 3.2510 New Israeli Shekels (NIS) per dollar as of December 31, 1996. Dollar figures are approximate.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
